  "description": "Bring bold vintage character and rugged grunge energy to your designs with Black Horse, a powerful display font featuring heavy letterforms and an authentic distressed texture. Its worn, weathered details create a raw vintage appearance that instantly adds personality and attitude to any project.\nDesigned for strong visual impact, Black Horse works beautifully for vintage logos, apparel graphics, t-shirt designs, motorcycle artwork, western branding, outdoor badges, posters, labels, stickers, merchandise, and retro typography. The distressed texture gives the letters a naturally aged and rugged appearance, making it ideal for designs inspired by old prints, worn signage, classic Americana, and vintage merchandise.\nUse Black Horse for bold headlines, statement graphics, brand identities, packaging, album artwork, sports-inspired designs, and creative projects that need a strong old-school, grunge, distressed, and rugged aesthetic.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring bold vintage character and rugged grunge energy to your designs with Black Horse, a powerful display font featuring heavy letterforms and an authentic distressed texture. Its worn, weathered details create a raw vintage appearance that instantly adds personality and attitude to any project.</p>\n<p>Designed for strong visual impact, Black Horse works beautifully for vintage logos, apparel graphics, t-shirt designs, motorcycle artwork, western branding, outdoor badges, posters, labels, stickers, merchandise, and retro typography. The distressed texture gives the letters a naturally aged and rugged appearance, making it ideal for designs inspired by old prints, worn signage, classic Americana, and vintage merchandise.</p>\n<p>Use Black Horse for bold headlines, statement graphics, brand identities, packaging, album artwork, sports-inspired designs, and creative projects that need a strong old-school, grunge, distressed, and rugged aesthetic.</p>",
